What is Women Safety Software?
Women Safety Software refers to specialized digital platforms combining GPS, AI, and IoT technologies to provide real-time protection for women. These solutions typically feature one-touch emergency alerts, automatic distress triggers, safe route navigation, and encrypted communication channels - often integrated with wearables for continuous protection. Designed to address gender-specific security challenges, these applications serve critical needs during commuting, late-night travel, remote work situations, and emergency scenarios.

